<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</link><description>由于人工智能贸易的破裂和利率上升刺激了对避险资产的需求，美元有望实现两年来最长的月度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024'&gt;“美元风暴”：美元有望实现 2024 年以来最长涨幅&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：‘Dollar Storm:’ Greenback on Track for Longest Winning Run Since 2024&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/-dollar-storm-greenback-on-track-for-longest-winning-run-since-2024</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:44:27 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</link><description>由于中东能源基础设施和油轮遭受袭击引发了人们对敌对行动升级的担忧，油价本月首次出现周度上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27'&gt;11 月 27 日最新石油市场新闻和分析&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Latest Oil Market News and Analysis for Nov. 27&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/latest-oil-market-news-and-analysis-for-nov-27</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 23:05:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</link><description>在该国最著名的银行家之一被任命为新财政部长后，巴西资产上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister'&gt;卢拉任命银行家为财政部长后巴西资产上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Brazil Assets Rally After Lula Names Banker as Finance Minister&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/brazil-assets-rally-after-lula-names-banker-luiz-carlos-trabuco-cappi-finance-minister</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 01:08:00 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</link><description>周四，亚洲股市可能会在科技股上涨的基础上推动美国股指期货上涨，风险偏好复苏的迹象提振了包括铜和比特币在内的资产。也门胡塞武装袭击了沙特一家重要炼油厂后，油价上涨。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap'&gt;亚洲股票期货信号上涨，油价再次上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Asian Stocks Rise for Second Day, Treasuries Slip: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/asian-stock-futures-signal-gains-oil-climbs-again-markets-wrap</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 21:59:57 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</link><description>第二财政部长阿米尔·哈姆扎·阿齐赞表示，如果亚洲航空集团有限公司的财务困难恶化，马来西亚可能会考虑介入支持该公司，因为政府寻求保护国内航空连通性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen'&gt;马来西亚称如果亚航财务困境恶化可能会进行干预&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Malaysia Says May Intervene If AirAsia’s Struggles Worsen&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/malaysia-says-may-intervene-if-airasia-s-financial-woes-worsen</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:22:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>